igned}4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{w}\\ne 0\n$$\n\n- Since we got a nonzero vector in the last step, we now compute the image of $w$ under the action of $A-8I:$\n\n$$\n(A-8I)w=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=0\n$$\n\nSo, we obtain the following chain of maps:\n\n$$\n{{[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{v}\\overset{A-8I\\,}{\\to }{{[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{w}\\overset{A-8I\\,}{\\to }{{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{0}\n$$\n\nHere, we see that $A-8I$ maps $v$ to $0$ in $2$ steps.\n\nTherefore:\n\n$\\,$ *$v$ is a generalized eigenvector of rank $2$ corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =8$ of $A.$*\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" 13194139535980 true] [17592186378060 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378061 13194139535980 true] [17592186378060 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378062 13194139535980 true] [17592186378060 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378063 13194139535980 true] [17592186378060 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378064 13194139535980 true] [17592186378060 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378065 13194139535980 true] [17592186378060 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535980 true] [17592186378060 1041 "selection" 13194139535980 true] [17592186378060 1104 #edb/ref 17592186378064 13194139535980 true] [17592186378060 1110 #uuid "6c8cd08d-1e45-5cd3-ab4a-88c12496427c" 13194139535980 true] [17592186378061 1034 "None of the statements are true" 13194139535980 true] [17592186378061 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535980 true] [17592186378061 1111 #uuid "b6f57943-22b8-51cf-a255-84d19a5225cf" 13194139535980 true] [17592186378062 1034 "I and III only" 13194139535980 true] [17592186378062 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535980 true] [17592186378062 1111 #uuid "0520418f-35ce-5034-96ab-4304598f7b9c" 13194139535980 true] [17592186378063 1034 "I only" 13194139535980 true] [17592186378